 * The ability has two main [[aura]] components:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Aura}} {{Symbol|Lifesteal}}
*** Affects Wraith King and only {{U|Wraith King Skeleton|text=Wraith King Skeletons}}.
*** Stacks additively with other [[lifesteal]] sources.
*** Does not lifesteal off the following units:
**** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
**** {{M|Buildings}}
**** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Aura}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|skeleton_king_vampiric_spirit}}
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} or {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
**** An {{M|on-death effect}} that only affects Wraith King by default, and enters Wraith Form in the following conditions:
***** Procs whenever Wraith King {{ValueColor||or the affected allied hero|agh}} attempts to fall below 1 {{M|current health}}.
***** {{cf|aghnotes}} Considers {{A|Meepo|Divided We Stand|text=Meepo Clones}} and {{M|The Double}} as heroes; other {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions}}, and {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
**** Does not proc under the following conditions:
***** When affected by the following abilities:
****** {{A|Dazzle|Shallow Grave}}
****** {{A|Troll Warlord|Battle Trance}}
***** When other {{M|reincarnation}} sources are available.
***** {{M|Forced kill}} sources.
*** Wraith Form has the following additional properties:
**** Does not grant {{M|incoming damage}} reduction.
**** Sets the affected hero's {{M|min health}} to 1 for its duration.
**** Additionally grants the affected allied hero the following bonuses:
***** {{M|Phase movement}}.
***** {{M|Unobstructed movement}}.
**** Offensive abilities and attacks still interact with allied Wraith Form heroes as usual, with existing {{M|buffs}} and {{M|debuffs}} continuing to affect them.
**** {{Symbol|Kill|Force}}
***** Applies a [[forced killed]] effect onto the affected allied hero when Wraith Form ends, crediting the kill to the enemy hero that procced the affected allied's Wraith Form.
***** The {{M|death}} cannot be prevented and bypasses {{M|invulnerable}} sources.
****** Other {{M|reincarnation}} sources proc as per normal once the hero dies.
******* Skilling {{A|Wraith King|Reincarnation}} during Wraith Form (and having sufficient mana, without {{M|Aghanim's Shard}}) will trigger Reincarnation after Wraith Form ends.
****** {{cf|aghnotes}} Allied heroes {{M|dying|x}} in Wraith Form have their respawn time reduced.

* {{cf|expr}}
** {{M|Lifesteal}}: {{Code|{{#var:Vampiric Spirit type1 value1}} + {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Wraith King|v1r}}%|tal|x}} + ({{#var:Vampiric Spirit basic1}} × SelfLvl)}}
** Wraith form duration: {{Code|{{#var:Vampiric Spirit value4}} + {{ValueColor||1|agh|x}} + [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌊]]({{#var:Vampiric Spirit basic2}} × SelfLvl / 6)[[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌋]]}}
** {{M|Respawn time}}: {{Code|RespawnTimeLvl - WraithFormDuration}}

