| desc = Wraith King sears an enemy unit with spectral fire, dealing damage and stunning, then dealing damage over time and slowing the target.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Has {{#var:Wraithfire Blast basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|skeleton_king_hellfire_blast}}
** Deals {{calc|v1+v2*{{#var:Wraithfire Blast value4}}|v1={{#var:Wraithfire Blast value1}}|v2={{#var:Wraithfire Blast value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1+v2*({{#var:Wraithfire Blast value4}}+{{Show|T|Wraith King|v1l}})|v1={{#var:Wraithfire Blast value1}}|v2={{#var:Wraithfire Blast value2}}}}|10tal}}) {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} over the entire duration.
** Has an effective max total {{calc|{{#var:Wraithfire Blast value4}}+v1|v1={{#var:Wraithfire Blast value5 tal}}}}-second ({{Symbol|bonus t1l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|{{#var:Wraithfire Blast value4}}+v1+{{#explode:{{Show|T|Wraith King|v1l}}|/}}|v1={{#var:Wraithfire Blast value5 tal}}}}|10tal}}) {{M|movement speed}} slow duration as it includes the duration of the {{M|stun}}.
*** This ability component is affected by {{M|status resistance}}.

* {{cf|talnotes}} The {{ValueColor||Reincarnation casts Wraithfire Blasts|25tal}} {{M|talent|t=t4l}} directly uses {{A|Wraith King|Wraithfire Blast}}'s ability values, it does nothing if the ability is not learned upon proc.

